+the one remaining f5b0t/f5b0u/f5b0v final confirmation over the signed RED,
+contract correction, production candidate and retained evidence.
+
+Stop and replace this selected contract with a separately reviewed
+transactional application-port slice if review or consumer audit demonstrates
+that any shipped consumer requires durable exactly-once external effects. That
+slice must own its public API, storage schema, effect/receipt atomicity,
+ambiguous outcomes, restart, corruption, migration, pruning and compatibility;
+no receipt-only patch is sufficient. No production behavior, wire/protobuf,
+authority, checkpoint, ACL, cryptography, dependency, threshold, timeout or
+workload change is authorized here.
